<title>UK: Lehman Brothers appoints director for MTN trading.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers appoints director for MTN trading.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers has appointed Mark Ames as director on the medium term notes (MTN) trading desk, it said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>He will work alongside Tiina Lee, the head of the desk, the statement said.</p>
<p>Ames has worked for Lehman Brother for the past three years in derivative sales and as part of the structured note trading team in New York.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
